    38	## Bodies carried
    39	
    40	- **Cael:** ribs mended (twinge on a stair at most); forearm healed. Anchor idle by naming; thresholds still lean. Shadow sealed on Seln's terms; rent from waking; one drift held (ch42, the dark road). Storm: the lane's bill ten counts (one lane, the night spar, ten counts).
    41	- **Lira:** right ankle sound to the touch by day 106; the price is trust (she checks it on landing). Back on the closed floor day 106. Loss day 111; the correction (land on the right on purpose); the win day 128. Left arm carried close from habit only.
    42	- **Brom:** shoulder sound; the day-45 Velmere letter sealed in his left pocket until day 173, then squared on his table, still sealed.
    43	- **Karis:** right fingers a shade paler; uses the left for small ignitions; none in M7.
