    81	
    82	1. **Day 138, the eighth sitting (~1,300).** Gault produces his notes in the house's boards; attests; "I have written that down" turned on the clerk. Jent: "The petitioner relies on none of it." Karis's second supplemental (the ninety-one; persons by conduct only) received. Lira in the benches. Cael: the minute grows; nothing in it reaches the frame.
