    84	3. **Day 151, the year's last supervised bout (~1,300).** Wing three; a Mire third-year (Iron Rank Five) who makes the floor feel deeper; the rotation line in Hesk's book; the band held — four bursts on boards and never a fifth, two contacts, the give shut. Ephram at the rail charts it; the provision's hours for the year signed complete; Ephram folds the chart and writes on the back of it, small, and puts it in the captain's file. Cael can't see what. "Hiding has turned into waiting."
    85	4. **Vastin's window (~1,000).** The renewed request for certification in *In*; he reads it whole; one line at its foot; signs; *done*. The clerk takes it down. Nothing else.
