    44	
    45	"I'd have brought it in the morning," Bracken said, to the room and to nobody. "It seemed to me that a man should get the best paper of his life on the day it was written and not the day after." He put it on the table at Brom's place and went out and shut the door, and the shutting was as much as Bracken had ever said about anything.
    46	
    47	Brom read it.
    48	
    49	Advancement to Iron-tier. Found. Recommended. The season record entered, the continental title cited, the panel's language the driest possible affirmation of the least surprising outcome the district had processed in years. His family's whole ledger, settled in one paragraph — the number the Velmere household had priced a big careful boy out of at fourteen, awarded, on a form, with a line for his signature and a date.
    50	
